 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "学習室の報告を確認しました。差は二十ポイント、元の割合と比べると五十パーセントの増加ですね。地域調査では、どんな統計表を使いますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D001-1",
    "C52-D001-2",
    "C52-D001-3"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 11.545,
   "duration_sec": 11.545
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "まず県内と全国を比べたいです。各地の生産量や貿易額があっても、規模が違うので、そのまま順位をつけられません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D002-1",
    "C52-D002-2"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 11.895,
   "end_sec": 20.907,
   "duration_sec": 9.012
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "一人当たりの数字も必要ですね。金額が一億円台なのか、一兆円に達するのか、単位にも注意しましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D003-1",
    "C52-D003-2"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 21.257,
   "end_sec": 28.795,
   "duration_sec": 7.538
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D005",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。兆は億の一万倍ですね。近年の月間の数字と例年の年間の数字を混ぜないようにします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D005-1",
    "C52-D005-2",
    "C52-D005-3"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 29.145,
   "end_sec": 37.468,
   "duration_sec": 8.323
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D006",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "地価が下がると、人口も比例して減ると書けますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D006-1"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 37.818,
   "end_sec": 41.469,
   "duration_sec": 3.651
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D007",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "それは確認が必要です。緩やかな低下なのか急増の後なのかで、見え方も違います。差がつく理由は、表だけでは分かりません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D007-1",
    "C52-D007-2",
    "C52-D007-3"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 41.819,
   "end_sec": 51.094,
   "duration_sec": 9.275
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D008",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "「ブームで需要が爆発的に拡大し、値段はうなぎ登りだ」という見出しを見ました。大量に売れたという意味ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D008-1",
    "C52-D008-2"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 51.444,
   "end_sec": 59.794,
   "duration_sec": 8.35
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D009",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "いいえ。関心が高まっても、売れた数量は別です。価格が落ち着くまでの記録を示してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D009-1",
    "C52-D009-2",
    "C52-D009-3"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 60.144,
   "end_sec": 66.953,
   "duration_sec": 6.809
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D010",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "教育の分野なら、就学率と識字率ですね。数がほぼ同じでも、量的な比較だけでは学ぶ環境を評価できません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D010-1",
    "C52-D010-2"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 67.303,
   "end_sec": 76.667,
   "duration_sec": 9.364
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D011",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "機器の普及率も同様です。地域の半数弱の家庭にあると言うと、五割未満ですね。多少の差にも意味があるかもしれません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D011-1",
    "C52-D011-2",
    "C52-D011-3"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
