   "duration_sec": 8.865
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D012",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "三十人足らずの調査でも、数百人に及ぶ調査でも、参加しなかった人の声は反映できない場合がありますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D012-1"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 86.232,
   "end_sec": 93.671,
   "duration_sec": 7.439
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D013",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "そうですね。トップに次ぐ二位への躍進という言い方も、順位だけを強調しています。実際の点の差も必要です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D013-1",
    "C52-D013-2",
    "C52-D013-3"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 94.021,
   "end_sec": 102.791,
   "duration_sec": 8.77
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D014",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "分かりました。説明は初めて読む人にも分かるぐらい丁寧にします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D014-1",
    "C52-D014-2"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 103.141,
   "end_sec": 107.653,
   "duration_sec": 4.512
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C52-D015",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "回答者の負担も考えると、質問は少ないほうがいいですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C52-D015-1"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
